[error] ModuleDependencyCycle  module.eco:1:1

  the module dependencies form a cycle: cyclea -> cycleb -> cyclea. A module is parsed completely before the next one starts, so it can only name symbols from modules parsed before it - which makes a cycle unsatisfiable rather than merely unsupported.

